anus%27_Blessing_(Condition)\" title=\"Silvanus' Blessing (Condition)\">Silvanus' Blessing</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Radius:&nbsp;8 m (27 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠Radius:&nbsp;8 m (27 ft)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Has <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Nature\" title=\"Nature\">Nature</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Animal_Handling\" title=\"Animal Handling\">Animal Handling</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Idyllic_Aura\">Sources of Idyllic Aura</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Idol_of_Silvanus\" title=\"Idol of Silvanus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Idol_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Idol_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Idol_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Idol_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Idol_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Idol_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Idol_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Idol_of_Silvanus_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href